---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="VarAC modem compatibility" description="Track Linkwise compatibility testing for VarAC HF chat and see the checks required for a supported configuration.">
  <article class="wrap section guide">
    <span class="state">Qualification pending</span>
    <h1>Linkwise with VarAC</h1>
    <p class="lede">VarAC HF chat is a target for Linkwise. End-to-end qualification is pending.</p>
    <h2>What the test covers</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Attach VarAC to the Linkwise command and DATA sockets using the client’s VARA HF configuration.</li>
      <li>Establish a radio-free session and exchange messages in both directions with exact text recovery.</li>
      <li>Verify both peers disconnect cleanly and record the client version, bandwidth, and settings.</li>
    </ol>
    <p><a href="https://www.varac-hamradio.com/post/varac-quick-start-guide">Read the VarAC quick start ↗</a></p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
